 public function requestCancellation(int$id,int$u,int$lock):array{return$this->tx(function()use($id,$u,$lock){$task=$this->tasks->lockOwnedForResponse($id,$u)??throw new TaskNotFoundException('not_found');if((int)$task['lock_version']!==$lock)throw new TaskConcurrencyException('concurrency_conflict');$from=(string)$task['status'];$this->machine->assertTransition($from,'cancelled');$step=null;$execution=null;if($from==='waiting_user'&&($stepId=(int)($task['current_step_id_']??0))>0){$step=$this->steps->lockCurrentWaitingUser($stepId,$id);if($step===null)throw new TaskTransitionException('current_step_not_waiting_user');$this->stepMachine->assertTransition('waiting_user','cancelled');$waiting=$this->executions->lockWaitingByStep($id,$stepId);if(count($waiting)>1)throw new TaskTransitionException('waiting_execution_ambiguous');if($waiting!==[]){$execution=$waiting[0];$this->executionMachine->assertTransition('waiting','cancelled');$this->executions->cancelWaiting((int)$execution['id_']);}$this->steps->updateStatus($stepId,'cancelled',(int)$step['lock_version']);}$now=gmdate('Y-m-d H:i:s.u');$cancelled=$this->tasks->updateStatus($id,$u,'cancelled',$lock,['cancel_requested_at'=>$now]);$this->events->append(['task_id'=>$id,'step_id'=>$step===null?null:(int)$step['id_'],'execution_id'=>$execution===null?null:(int)$execution['id_'],'actor_type'=>'user','actor_user_id'=>$u,'event_key'=>'task_cancelled','from_status'=>$from,'to_status'=>'cancelled','summary'=>'Cancelación solicitada.']);return$cancelled;});}
 public function retryTask(int$id,int$u,int$lock):array{return$this->tx(function()use($id,$u,$lock){$t=$this->tasks->lockOwnedForRetry($id,$u)??throw new TaskNotFoundException('not_found');if((int)$t['lock_version']!==$lock)throw new TaskConcurrencyException('concurrency_conflict');if($t['status']!=='failed')throw new TaskTransitionException('retry_task_invalid');$this->machine->assertTransition('failed','ready');$nextAttempt=(int)$t['attempt_count']+1;if($nextAttempt>(int)$t['max_attempts'])throw new TaskTransitionException('attempt_limit');$stepId=(int)($t['current_step_id_']??0);if($stepId<1)throw new TaskTransitionException('retry_step_invalid');$step=$this->steps->lockForRetry($stepId,$id)??throw new TaskTransitionException('retry_step_invalid');if($step['status']!=='failed')throw new TaskTransitionException('retry_step_invalid');$this->stepMachine->assertTransition('failed','ready');$this->steps->authorizeRetry($stepId,$id,(int)$step['lock_version'],$nextAttempt);$n=$this->tasks->retry($id,$u,$lock);$this->events->append(['task_id'=>$id,'step_id'=>$stepId,'actor_type'=>'user','actor_user_id'=>$u,'event_key'=>'task_ready','from_status'=>'failed','to_status'=>'ready','summary'=>'Tarea preparada para reintento.','details'=>['attempt_count'=>(int)$n['attempt_count'],'authorized_attempt'=>$nextAttempt]]);return$n;});}
 public function activatePlannedTask(int$id,int$u,int$stepId,string$target,int$lock):array{return$this->tx(function()use($id,$u,$stepId,$target,$lock){if(!in_array($target,['ready','waiting_user'],true))throw new TaskValidationException('manual_mode_invalid');$task=$this->tasks->lockOwnedForResponse($id,$u)??throw new TaskNotFoundException('not_found');if((int)$task['lock_version']!==$lock)throw new TaskConcurrencyException('concurrency_conflict');if($task['status']!=='pending')throw new TaskTransitionException('manual_task_not_pending');$step=$this->steps->findById($stepId)??throw new TaskNotFoundException('step_not_found');if((int)$step['task_id_']!==$id||$step['status']!==$target)throw new TaskTransitionException('manual_step_invalid');$this->machine->assertTransition('pending',$target);$this->tasks->setCurrentStep($id,$u,$stepId);$updated=$this->tasks->updateStatus($id,$u,$target,$lock);$this->events->append(['task_id'=>$id,'step_id'=>$stepId,'actor_type'=>'user','actor_user_id'=>$u,'event_key'=>'task_'.$target,'from_status'=>'pending','to_status'=>$target,'summary'=>$target==='ready'?'Task manual lista para Worker.':'Task manual esperando aprobación.']);if($target==='waiting_user')$this->events->append(['task_id'=>$id,'step_id'=>$stepId,'actor_type'=>'system','event_key'=>'approval_requested','to_status'=>'waiting_user','summary'=>'Aprobación de inicio solicitada.']);return$updated;});}
 public function rescheduleTask(int$id,int$u,?string$scheduled,int$lock):array{return$this->tx(function()use($id,$u,$scheduled,$lock){$task=$this->tasks->lockOwnedForResponse($id,$u)??throw new TaskNotFoundException('not_found');if((int)$task['lock_version']!==$lock)throw new TaskConcurrencyException('concurrency_conflict');if(!in_array($task['status'],['pending','ready','waiting_user'],true)||$this->tasks->hasExecutions($id))throw new TaskTransitionException('task_not_reschedulable');$updated=$this->tasks->reschedule($id,$u,$scheduled,$lock);$this->events->append(['task_id'=>$id,'actor_type'=>'user','actor_user_id'=>$u,'event_key'=>'task_rescheduled','from_status'=>$task['status'],'to_status'=>$task['status'],'summary'=>$scheduled===null?'Programación one-shot eliminada.':'Programación one-shot actualizada en UTC.','details'=>['scheduled_at'=>$scheduled]]);return$updated;});}
 public function prepareChatTurn(int$u,int$session,?int$project,int$message,string$key,string$title,string$objective,bool$auto,array$input=[]):ChatTaskContext{return$this->tx(function()use($u,$session,$project,$message,$key,$title,$objective,$auto,$input){$task=$this->tasks->findOwnedByIdempotencyKey($u,$key);if(!$task){$task=$this->tasks->create(['public_id'=>TaskPublicId::generate(),'user_id'=>$u,'created_by_user_id'=>$u,'project_id'=>$project,'session_id'=>$session,'origin_message_id'=>$message,'idempotency_key'=>$key,'origin_type'=>'chat','title'=>$title,'objective'=>$objective,'status'=>'pending','priority'=>'normal','max_attempts'=>1]);$this->event((int)$task['id_'],'task_created',null,'pending','Tarea de chat creada.',$u);}$step=$this->steps->findByKey((int)$task['id_'],'respond');if(!$step){$input['execution_mode']=($input['execution_mode']??'sync')==='async'?'async':'sync';$step=$this->steps->createRespond((int)$task['id_'],$input);$this->event((int)$task['id_'],'step_created',null,'pending','Step respond creado.',$u,(int)$step['id_']);}
